# What the image build reads is short: the root cargo manifests,
# `.cargo/config.toml`, `rust-toolchain.toml`, `crates/`, `tasks/` (only so the
# root workspace's member list resolves), the root JS manifests, `packages/` and
# `scripts/`. Everything named here is large, host-specific, or a build output
# that has to be regenerated inside the image rather than lifted out of a
# checkout.
#
# Unlike .gitignore, a bare name matches only at the context root; `**/` is what
# reaches nested directories.

# Rust build trees. The wasm client is excluded from the root workspace and so
# has one of its own; both run to tens of gigabytes.
target
crates/agent-share-wasm-client/target

# The important one. This is where the wasm and its glue land, it is gitignored,
# and it is therefore present in every working checkout. Copying it in would let
# a stale host build become the image's wasm — the exact failure the
# content-addressed name in `scripts/wasm-asset.ts` exists to make
# impossible. The build rebuilds it from source.
crates/agent-share-wasm-client/dist

# Front-end installs and output: reinstalled and rebundled in the image.
**/node_modules
dist

# Generated by `build.ts` from whatever wasm the build just produced, and
# gitignored here: the hash of this machine's last build, and the glue mirrored
# from it. Either one copied in would pin the bundle to a binary the image never
# built.
packages/agent-share-wasm/src/path.ts
packages/agent-share-wasm/src/glue

# Nothing in the image build reads git metadata, and `cargo task web-image`
# resolves the tag on the host before calling docker.
.git
.gitignore

# Not part of the web app.
#
# `packages/agent-share-node` is the npx receiver and is equally not part of it,
# but it cannot be listed here: it is a workspace member, and
# `bun install --frozen-lockfile` fails when a member's manifest is absent. It
# is ~12 KB of JS, the build never bundles it, and the runtime stage takes only
# `dist/` and `serve.js` — so it costs a place in the install layer's cache key
# and nothing in the shipped image.
docs
test
deploy
.claude
README.md
LICENSE
todo.md
clippy.toml

# Editor and OS noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# Never send secrets, whatever else moves above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
